message: If you use NEBULA in research or software, please cite this repository.
title: NEBULA Trust-oriented Explainable Hybrid Search for Engineering Knowledge
type: software
authors:
  - name: Bishrav
repository-code: https://github.com/Bishrav/NEBULA
license: MIT
keywords:
  - information retrieval
  - trustworthy AI
  - hybrid search
  - engineering knowledge
  - distributed systems
  - reproducible research
abstract: NEBULA is a research prototype for trust-oriented and explainable hybrid retrieval over engineering knowledge, combining lexical, semantic, freshness, source-authority, graph, evidence, and reliability signals.
